  "description_short": "Artisan coffee and freshly baked treats in a cozy Knysna Central café with a neighbourhood feel.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Gray Street in the heart of Knysna Central, The Daily Coffee Café has quickly become a local favourite for quality coffee and genuine hospitality. This welcoming spot serves carefully crafted espresso drinks alongside a tempting selection of freshly baked pastries, breads, and light meals that change with the seasons.\n\nThe café's relaxed atmosphere makes it ideal for a morning coffee run, a leisurely breakfast, or an afternoon pick-me-up with friends. Their baristas take pride in each cup, and the homemade baked goods – from flaky croissants to hearty savoury treats – are made with care. Whether you're grabbing something to go or settling in with a book, the friendly service and consistent quality keep regulars coming back.\n\nConveniently located in central Knysna, it's an easy stop before exploring the waterfront or heading out on the day's adventures. The Daily Coffee Café proves that sometimes the best experiences are the simple ones done exceptionally well.",
